  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <span style=\"color: #000000;\"> has released the result for the Polytechnic/Diploma Certificate Entrance Competitive Examination (DCECE-PE, PPE, PMD &amp; PM) 2026 on its official website. Applications for the DCECE Bihar Polytechnic Admit Card 2026 were accepted from 19 March 2026, to 27 April 2026. The examination was held from 23-24 May 2026. Candidates&nbsp;who appeared for this examination&nbsp;can download their DCECE Bihar Polytechnic Result 2026 from the link given below.</span></span></span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Bihar Combined Enterance Competetive Examination Board (BCECEB)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">DCECE Bihar Polytechnic DCECE Bihar Polytechnic Result 2026 </span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>19 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>27 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>27 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Online Editing-Application Form : <strong>28-29 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">PE Exam Date :<strong> 23 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">PM, PMM Exam Date :<strong> 24 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card Available :&nbsp;<strong>14 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Result Available : <strong>11 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>For I-Subject Group&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">General, BC, EBC :&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 750/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SC, ST, DQ :&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 480/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>For II-Subject Group&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">General, BC, EBC : <strong>Rs. 850/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SC, ST, DQ : <strong>Rs. 530/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>For III- Subject Group&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">General, BC, EBC : <strong>Rs. 950/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SC, ST, DQ : <strong>Rs. 630/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Bihar DCECE Polytechnic / Diploma Admissions 2026 : Age Limit</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 31 December 2026</span></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>PE </strong>: No Minimum Age Limit</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>PMM </strong>:&nbsp;15 – 30 years</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>PM (GNM, ANM) </strong>:&nbsp;17 – 35 years</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>PM (Other Subject) </strong>:&nbsp;17 – 32 years</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Bihar DCECE Polytechnic / Diploma Admissions 2026 : Course Details</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Course Name&nbsp;</strong></span>: Diploma Certificate Entrance Competitive Examination (DCECE-2026)</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Exam Conduct</span>&nbsp;</strong>: Bihar Combined Entrance Competitive Examination Board (BCECEB)</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Bihar DCECE Polytechnic / Diploma Admissions 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>PE </strong>:&nbsp;10<sup>th</sup> standard pass Or Appearing from a recognized board.</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>PMM</strong> : 10<sup>th</sup> standard pass Or Appearing from a recognized board with English and Science subjects.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>PM (</strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>i)</strong> : 10+2 Intermediate Exam with Science (Physics, Chemistry, English, Math/Bio) for <strong>Diploma in Pharmacy</strong> course</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>PM (</strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>ii)</strong> : 10+2 Intermediate Exam with Science (Physics, Chemistry, Biology) with 40% marks for <strong>GNM Course (Female only)</strong></span></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>PM (iii)</strong> : 10+2 Intermediate Exam with 40% marks for <strong>ANM Course (Female only)</strong> with English as a subject</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">for other courses check official notification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download DCECE Bihar Polytechnic Result 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Open the <strong>Download Result</strong>&nbsp;link from the&nbsp;<strong>Important Links&nbsp;</strong>box placed below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates will be redirected to a new page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In this page, candidates have to fill up the required fields given as following:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Registration ID/ Roll Number/ Name</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Date of Birth</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Father’s Name (In case of searching by name)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Captcha code</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">And Click on&nbsp;<strong>Search</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After submitting the correct details, applicants will be able to download the result.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Bihar DCECE Polytechnic / Diploma Application Form 2026 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Selection will be based on Online CBT Examination.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"co