olor: #800000;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0;\"><strong><a href=\"https://bceceboard.bihar.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></strong></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Important Question</strong></span></h3>\n<p><strong>Q. Has the Bihar DCECE Polytechnic Result 2026 been released?</strong><br>\n<strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>Yes, the Bihar DCECE Polytechnic Result has been released on the official website of Bihar BCECEB.</p>\n<p><strong>Q. When was the Bihar DCECE Polytechnic Result 2026 released?</strong><br>\n<strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>The result was released on&nbsp;<strong>11 June 2026</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>Q. Where can the result be downloaded from?</strong><br>\n<strong>Answer.</strong>&nbsp;The result is available on the&nbsp;<strong>official BCECEB website</strong>: <span style=\"color: #000000;\">bceceboard.bihar.gov.in</span></p>\n<p><strong>Q. Is the result in PDF format?</strong><br>\n<strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>Yes, the result is available in&nbsp;<strong>PDF format</strong>, making it easy to download and view.</p>\n<p><strong>Q. Are the cut-off marks mentioned in the result?</strong><br>\n<strong>Answer.</strong>&nbsp;Yes, the&nbsp;<strong>cut-off marks</strong>&nbsp;for different categories are provided in the PDF along with the result.</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What is BCECEB Official Website?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>The Official Website of BCECEB is https://bceceboard.bihar.gov.in/</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
